<pb n="[VIII]" facs="#f0014"/>
<div type="contents"><head><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#g">Inhalt.</hi></hi></head><list><item><hi rendition="#right">Seite</hi></item><lb/>
<item>Vorrede des Verfa&#x017F;&#x017F;ers. <ref>1</ref></item><lb/>
